{
  "verso": "1.1",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Palmer Penguins with PowerShell DataFrames and Vega-Lite",
    "created": "2026-08-01T00:00:00+00:00",
    "modified": "2026-08-01T00:00:00+00:00",
    "defaultKernel": "powershell",
    "activeLayout": {
      "extensionId": "verso.layout.notebook",
      "layoutId": "notebook"
    }
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "5e5d2ba8-d10c-472a-b8db-633d72381e0c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Palmer Penguins with PowerShell DataFrames and Vega-Lite\n\nThis notebook demonstrates an end-to-end data-analysis workflow in PowerShell: load a public CSV dataset, clean and type it as a \u0060Microsoft.Data.Analysis.DataFrame\u0060, inspect and aggregate the data, and build interactive Vega-Lite charts.\n\nThe dataset comes from the [palmerpenguins project](https://allisonhorst.github.io/palmerpenguins/)."
    },
    {
      "id": "110bb8c9-bbf2-46fe-b92d-996e07427e1c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Prerequisites\n\nInstall the \u0060DataFrame\u0060 PowerShell module from a regular PowerShell terminal before starting Verso:\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060powershell\nInstall-Module DataFrame -Scope CurrentUser\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\nThe notebook downloads the CSV and Vega-Lite browser libraries at runtime, so the first run requires internet access. No dataset file is written to the repository."
    },
    {
      "id": "b0917af3-a2bf-41ce-a17c-ec696f7d746c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$module = Get-Module -ListAvailable -Name DataFrame |\n    Sort-Object Version -Descending |\n    Select-Object -First 1\n\nif (-not $module) {\n    throw \u0027The DataFrame module is required. Install it from a regular PowerShell terminal with: Install-Module DataFrame -Scope CurrentUser\u0027\n}\n\nImport-Module $module.Path -Force\n\n$url = \u0027https://raw.githubusercontent.com/allisonhorst/palmerpenguins/main/inst/extdata/penguins.csv\u0027\n$csv = (Invoke-WebRequest -Uri $url).Content\n\n\u0022Downloaded $($csv.Length) characters from the Palmer Penguins dataset.\u0022",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-progress",
          "content": "{\u0022activity\u0022:\u0022Reading web response stream\u0022,\u0022status\u0022:\u0022Reading web response stream completed. Bytes downloaded: 15241\u0022,\u0022percent\u0022:null,\u0022done\u0022:true}"
        },
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Downloaded 15241 characters from the Palmer Penguins dataset."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b436f4dd-af05-4fd2-aa25-8a01474bd795",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Load and clean the DataFrame\n\nThe source CSV uses \u0060NA\u0060 for missing values. \u0060Microsoft.Data.Analysis\u0060 recognizes empty numeric fields as nulls, so the input is normalized in memory before import. Explicit column types keep the measurement columns numeric."
    },
    {
      "id": "ec625e92-a20b-4b6d-894d-be339c76901d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$cleanCsv = $csv -replace \u0027(?m)(^|,)NA(?=,|$)\u0027, \u0027$1\u0027\n\n$columnTypes = @(\n    [string], # species\n    [string], # island\n    [double], # bill_length_mm\n    [double], # bill_depth_mm\n    [int],    # flipper_length_mm\n    [int],    # body_mass_g\n    [string], # sex\n    [int]     # year\n)\n\n$penguins = Import-DataFrame \u0060\n    -String $cleanCsv \u0060\n    -ColumnType $columnTypes\n\n$penguins.Head(10)",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-dataframe{--df-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-bg-default,#fff));--df-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-fg-default,#1e1e1e));--df-muted:var(--vscode-descriptionForeground,var(--verso-fg-muted,#6b7280));--df-border:var(--vscode-editorWidget-border,var(--verso-border-default,#d1d5db));--df-header:var(--vscode-editorWidget-background,var(--verso-bg-elevated,#f3f4f6));--df-hover:var(--vscode-list-hoverBackground,rgba(127,127,127,.12));font-family:var(--verso-font-family-mono,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe-scroll{max-width:100%;max-height:var(--df-max-height,600px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--df-border);}.verso-dataframe table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;background:var(--df-bg);color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--df-border);background:var(--df-header);font-weight:600;}.verso-dataframe td{max-width:360px;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--df-border);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.verso-dataframe tbody tr:hover{background:var(--df-hover);}.verso-dataframe-column-type{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;}.verso-dataframe-null{color:var(--df-muted);font-style:italic;}.verso-dataframe-footer,.verso-dataframe-empty{padding:7px 2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:12px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe\u0022 style=\u0022--df-max-height:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-scroll\u0022\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Especies\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eisland\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Double\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EDouble\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Double\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_depth_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EDouble\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Int32\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eflipper_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EInt32\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Int32\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebody_mass_g\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EInt32\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Esex\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Int32\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eyear\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EInt32\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E39.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18.7\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E181\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3750\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E39.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.4\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E186\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3800\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efemale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E195\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3250\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efemale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-null\u0022\u003Enull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-null\u0022\u003Enull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-null\u0022\u003Enull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-null\u0022\u003Enull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E36.7\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E193\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3450\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efemale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E39.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E190\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3650\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E38.9\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E181\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3625\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efemale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E39.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E195\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4675\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E34.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E193\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3475\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETorgersen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E42\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E190\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4250\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-footer\u0022\u003EShowing 10 of 10 rows\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d8aa8d30-a656-48c8-aac2-da5c76410df9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Inspect the data\n\nA DataFrame is one PowerShell object, so its row count is available through \u0060Rows.Count\u0060. \u0060Info()\u0060 reports the schema and non-null counts, while \u0060Description()\u0060 summarizes the numeric columns."
    },
    {
      "id": "9691f019-3ff8-44bb-9951-9d61f3bcad0a",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "\u0022Rows: $($penguins.Rows.Count)\u0022\n\u0022Columns: $($penguins.Columns.Count)\u0022\n\n$penguins.Info()\n$penguins.Description()",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Rows: 344\nColumns: 8"
        },
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-dataframe{--df-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-bg-default,#fff));--df-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-fg-default,#1e1e1e));--df-muted:var(--vscode-descriptionForeground,var(--verso-fg-muted,#6b7280));--df-border:var(--vscode-editorWidget-border,var(--verso-border-default,#d1d5db));--df-header:var(--vscode-editorWidget-background,var(--verso-bg-elevated,#f3f4f6));--df-hover:var(--vscode-list-hoverBackground,rgba(127,127,127,.12));font-family:var(--verso-font-family-mono,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe-scroll{max-width:100%;max-height:var(--df-max-height,600px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--df-border);}.verso-dataframe table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;background:var(--df-bg);color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--df-border);background:var(--df-header);font-weight:600;}.verso-dataframe td{max-width:360px;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--df-border);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.verso-dataframe tbody tr:hover{background:var(--df-hover);}.verso-dataframe-column-type{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;}.verso-dataframe-null{color:var(--df-muted);font-style:italic;}.verso-dataframe-footer,.verso-dataframe-empty{padding:7px 2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:12px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe\u0022 style=\u0022--df-max-height:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-scroll\u0022\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003EInfo\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Especies\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eisland\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_depth_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eflipper_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebody_mass_g\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Esex\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eyear\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDataType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.String\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.String\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.Double\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.Double\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.Int32\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.Int32\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.String\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESystem.Int32\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength (excluding null values)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E344\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E344\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E344\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E344\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-footer\u0022\u003EShowing 2 of 2 rows\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        },
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-dataframe{--df-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-bg-default,#fff));--df-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-fg-default,#1e1e1e));--df-muted:var(--vscode-descriptionForeground,var(--verso-fg-muted,#6b7280));--df-border:var(--vscode-editorWidget-border,var(--verso-border-default,#d1d5db));--df-header:var(--vscode-editorWidget-background,var(--verso-bg-elevated,#f3f4f6));--df-hover:var(--vscode-list-hoverBackground,rgba(127,127,127,.12));font-family:var(--verso-font-family-mono,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe-scroll{max-width:100%;max-height:var(--df-max-height,600px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--df-border);}.verso-dataframe table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;background:var(--df-bg);color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--df-border);background:var(--df-header);font-weight:600;}.verso-dataframe td{max-width:360px;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--df-border);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.verso-dataframe tbody tr:hover{background:var(--df-hover);}.verso-dataframe-column-type{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;}.verso-dataframe-null{color:var(--df-muted);font-style:italic;}.verso-dataframe-footer,.verso-dataframe-empty{padding:7px 2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:12px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe\u0022 style=\u0022--df-max-height:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-scroll\u0022\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003EDescription\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Single\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003ESingle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Single\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebill_depth_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003ESingle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Single\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eflipper_length_mm\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003ESingle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Single\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebody_mass_g\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003ESingle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Single\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Eyear\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003ESingle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength (excluding null values)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E342\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E344\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMax\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E59.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E231\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6300\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2009\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E32.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E172\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2700\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2007\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMean\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E43.66657\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.051455\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E199.74709\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4177.3257\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2008.029\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-footer\u0022\u003EShowing 4 of 4 rows\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bdd8e894-bf74-47e7-a794-fe329947be0f",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Aggregate by species\n\nThe DataFrame API can group rows and calculate aggregate values without converting them into ordinary PowerShell objects. The result is another DataFrame and is rendered by the same Verso formatter."
    },
    {
      "id": "e069ee63-33ea-4cb9-af5e-df4019ddb4d2",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$massBySpecies = $penguins.\n    GroupBy(\u0027species\u0027).\n    Mean(\u0027body_mass_g\u0027)\n\n$massBySpecies",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-dataframe{--df-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-bg-default,#fff));--df-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-fg-default,#1e1e1e));--df-muted:var(--vscode-descriptionForeground,var(--verso-fg-muted,#6b7280));--df-border:var(--vscode-editorWidget-border,var(--verso-border-default,#d1d5db));--df-header:var(--vscode-editorWidget-background,var(--verso-bg-elevated,#f3f4f6));--df-hover:var(--vscode-list-hoverBackground,rgba(127,127,127,.12));font-family:var(--verso-font-family-mono,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe-scroll{max-width:100%;max-height:var(--df-max-height,600px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--df-border);}.verso-dataframe table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;background:var(--df-bg);color:var(--df-fg);}.verso-dataframe th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--df-border);background:var(--df-header);font-weight:600;}.verso-dataframe td{max-width:360px;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--df-border);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.verso-dataframe tbody tr:hover{background:var(--df-hover);}.verso-dataframe-column-type{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;}.verso-dataframe-null{color:var(--df-muted);font-style:italic;}.verso-dataframe-footer,.verso-dataframe-empty{padding:7px 2px;color:var(--df-muted);font-size:12px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe\u0022 style=\u0022--df-max-height:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-scroll\u0022\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.String\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Especies\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EString\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth title=\u0022System.Double\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-name\u0022\u003Ebody_mass_g\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022verso-dataframe-column-type\u0022\u003EDouble\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdelie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3676.315789473684\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGentoo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5035.080645161291\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChinstrap\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3733.0882352941176\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-dataframe-footer\u0022\u003EShowing 3 of 3 rows\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3df60041-bfde-4db2-8199-cfe221e054aa",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Render Vega-Lite charts\n\n\u0060Show-VegaLite\u0060 serializes a declarative chart specification into a self-contained Verso widget. The widget loads pinned Vega, Vega-Lite, and Vega-Embed versions and renders inside an isolated iframe. Base64 encoding prevents JSON content from breaking the surrounding HTML document."
    },
    {
      "id": "2fc771ba-50d1-452c-93d6-243921fbfea2",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "function Show-VegaLite {\n    param(\n        [Parameter(Mandatory)]\n        $Spec\n    )\n\n    $specJson = $Spec | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 100 -Compress\n    $specBase64 = [Convert]::ToBase64String(\n        [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($specJson)\n    )\n\n    $document = @\u0022\n\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\u0022$specBase64\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, { renderer: \u0022svg\u0022, actions: true })\n            .catch(error =\u003E {\n                document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n                document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n            });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E\n\u0022@\n\n    $document | Display -MimeType \u0027text/x-verso-widget\u0027\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "95192b79-901f-4167-9a92-da78c3df3e6b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Bill length and flipper length\n\nThis scatter plot shows the relationship between bill length and flipper length. Color identifies species, shape identifies sex, and tooltips expose additional measurements. Vega-Lite reads and parses the original CSV string directly."
    },
    {
      "id": "e62f91d9-32c2-4324-8191-b52e2fc3ff2f",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$scatterSpec = [ordered]@{\n    \u0027$schema\u0027 = \u0027https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json\u0027\n    title  = \u0027Penguin bill length vs. flipper length\u0027\n    width  = \u0027container\u0027\n    height = 420\n    data = @{\n        values = $csv\n        format = @{\n            type = \u0027csv\u0027\n            parse = @{\n                bill_length_mm    = \u0027number\u0027\n                bill_depth_mm     = \u0027number\u0027\n                flipper_length_mm = \u0027number\u0027\n                body_mass_g       = \u0027number\u0027\n                year              = \u0027number\u0027\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    transform = @(\n        @{ filter = \u0027isValid(datum.bill_length_mm) \u0026\u0026 isValid(datum.flipper_length_mm)\u0027 }\n    )\n    mark = @{ type = \u0027point\u0027; filled = $true; size = 85; opacity = 0.75 }\n    encoding = @{\n        x = @{\n            field = \u0027bill_length_mm\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Bill length (mm)\u0027\n            scale = @{ zero = $false }\n        }\n        y = @{\n            field = \u0027flipper_length_mm\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Flipper length (mm)\u0027\n            scale = @{ zero = $false }\n        }\n        color = @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Species\u0027 }\n        shape = @{ field = \u0027sex\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Sex\u0027 }\n        tooltip = @(\n            @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Species\u0027 }\n            @{ field = \u0027island\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Island\u0027 }\n            @{ field = \u0027sex\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Sex\u0027 }\n            @{ field = \u0027bill_length_mm\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Bill length\u0027 }\n            @{ field = \u0027flipper_length_mm\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Flipper length\u0027 }\n            @{ field = \u0027body_mass_g\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Body mass\u0027 }\n        )\n    }\n}\n\nShow-VegaLite $scatterSpec",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-widget",
          "content": "\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, { renderer: \u0022svg\u0022, actions: true })\n            .catch(error =\u003E {\n                document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n                document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n            });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4e6c9bbc-cf80-40b5-8ac1-0bbd0e0487c3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Average body mass\n\nVega-Lite calculates the mean body mass for each species directly from the CSV records. Invalid numeric values are excluded before aggregation."
    },
    {
      "id": "389416a2-3550-4307-8961-7349d5e51eb1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$barSpec = [ordered]@{\n    \u0027$schema\u0027 = \u0027https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json\u0027\n    title  = \u0027Average body mass by species\u0027\n    width  = \u0027container\u0027\n    height = 360\n    data = @{\n        values = $csv\n        format = @{ type = \u0027csv\u0027; parse = @{ body_mass_g = \u0027number\u0027 } }\n    }\n    transform = @(\n        @{ filter = \u0027isValid(datum.body_mass_g)\u0027 }\n    )\n    mark = @{ type = \u0027bar\u0027; cornerRadius = 3 }\n    encoding = @{\n        x = @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Species\u0027; sort = \u0027-y\u0027 }\n        y = @{\n            field = \u0027body_mass_g\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; aggregate = \u0027mean\u0027\n            title = \u0027Average body mass (g)\u0027\n        }\n        color = @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; legend = $null }\n        tooltip = @(\n            @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = \u0027Species\u0027 }\n            @{\n                field = \u0027body_mass_g\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; aggregate = \u0027mean\u0027\n                title = \u0027Average mass\u0027; format = \u0027.0f\u0027\n            }\n        )\n    }\n}\n\nShow-VegaLite $barSpec",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-widget",
          "content": "\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, { renderer: \u0022svg\u0022, actions: true })\n            .catch(error =\u003E {\n                document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n                document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n            });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8ac3dd38-ef03-443c-b840-196d40412085",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Body-mass distributions\n\nFaceting creates one histogram per species. Shared axes make their distributions directly comparable, while the tooltip reports each bin range and count."
    },
    {
      "id": "890eaec0-5286-43b6-9a82-f24a9b8f24a5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$histogramSpec = [ordered]@{\n    \u0027$schema\u0027 = \u0027https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json\u0027\n    title = \u0027Body mass distribution by species\u0027\n    data = @{\n        values = $csv\n        format = @{ type = \u0027csv\u0027; parse = @{ body_mass_g = \u0027number\u0027 } }\n    }\n    transform = @(\n        @{ filter = \u0027isValid(datum.body_mass_g)\u0027 }\n    )\n    facet = @{\n        column = @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; title = $null }\n    }\n    spec = @{\n        width = 220\n        height = 280\n        mark = @{ type = \u0027bar\u0027; cornerRadius = 2 }\n        encoding = @{\n            x = @{\n                field = \u0027body_mass_g\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Body mass (g)\u0027\n                bin = @{ maxbins = 20 }\n            }\n            y = @{ aggregate = \u0027count\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Number of penguins\u0027 }\n            color = @{ field = \u0027species\u0027; type = \u0027nominal\u0027; legend = $null }\n            tooltip = @(\n                @{ field = \u0027body_mass_g\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; bin = $true; title = \u0027Body mass range\u0027 }\n                @{ aggregate = \u0027count\u0027; type = \u0027quantitative\u0027; title = \u0027Penguins\u0027 }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n    resolve = @{ scale = @{ x = \u0027shared\u0027; y = \u0027shared\u0027 } }\n}\n\nShow-VegaLite $histogramSpec",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-widget",
          "content": "\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, { renderer: \u0022svg\u0022, actions: true })\n            .catch(error =\u003E {\n                document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n                document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n            });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}